title: An assistant that works outside the folders here (another chat, in another editor) does not show on the canvas and cannot be followed; once it reads a file of a folder here it shows and is followed there
folders: rust-small
fixtures: plain
expect-log: an assistant \(Codex\) works outside the folders here: it is not followed
forbid-log: from outside the open folders
forbid-log: was opened to follow an assistant
forbid-log: script: agent needs

wait 3000
agent {"agent":"codex-1","name":"Codex","task":"Tidy the plain copy","action":"read","path":"{WORK}/fix/plain/src/main.rs","line":1,"lines":3}
wait 800
agent Codex
wait 2500
mark a-not-followed-outside
wait 600
agent {"agent":"codex-1","name":"Codex","task":"Tidy the plain copy","action":"read","path":"{WORK}/fix/rust-small/src/util.rs","line":1,"lines":2}
wait 800
agent Codex
wait 2500
mark b-followed-in-a-folder-here
wait 600
quit
